* MAX44245 Non-Inverting Amplifier 20V/V

* Power Supplies (+/- 15V)
V2 VCC 0 15
V3 VEE 0 -15

* Input Signal: 50 mV amplitude sine at 1 kHz
V1 IN 0 SINE(0 50m 1k) AC 1

* Amplifier Circuit (Gain = 1 + R1/R2 = 20)
* Pin order typically: IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT
X1 IN IN_N VCC VEE OUT MAX44245
R1 OUT IN_N 19k
R2 IN_N 0 1k

* Transient Analysis for 5ms (5 cycles at 1kHz)
.tran 0 5m 0 1u

* Measurements (taken from 2ms to 5ms to ignore startup transients)
.meas tran out_pp PP V(OUT) FROM 2m TO 5m
.meas tran in_pp PP V(IN) FROM 2m TO 5m
.meas tran gain_db param 20*log10(out_pp/in_pp)

.end
